# Guard film: the drawing-time meter with 400 worker ants walking on the spot (a 20 x 20 grid 0.6 blocks apart,
# 3 to 15 blocks from the camera, all drawn). The time each frame takes to draw goes into
# run-film/screenshots/frames.txt; compare it with the empty scene before it.
cmd time set noon
cmd weather clear
lens 30
cmd summon antcolonies:worker_ant -5.20 -60 -3.00 {NoAI:1b,Rotation:[90f,0f],CustomName:'"film:walk"'}
cmd summon antcolonies:worker_ant -5.20 -60 -2.40 {NoAI:1b,Rotation:[90f,0f],CustomName:'"film:walk"'}
